.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-RESTART 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-restart
.Nd restart a single service
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad restart
.Op Ar SERVICE
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad restart
restarts one service in the stack. With no argument it restarts
.Cm admin ,
the Command Center.
.Pp
If
.Ar SERVICE
names a compose-managed service it is restarted via
.Ic docker compose restart .
Otherwise the command looks for a matching admin-spawned content container,
trying the literal name, the
.Sy nomad_
prefix, and the
.Sy nomad_ Ns Ar SERVICE Ns Sy _server
form, so
.Ic nomad restart kiwix
finds the
.Sy nomad_kiwix_server
container. If nothing matches, it lists the known compose services and exits
with an error.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ar SERVICE
The service or container to restart. Defaults to
.Cm admin .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad restart
Restart the admin Command Center.
.It Ic nomad restart kiwix
Restart the kiwix content container, matched by name even though it is
admin-spawned and not in the compose file.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-up 1 ,
.Xr nomad-down 1
